      "content": "Hey, I'm in a massive bind with the NY trading account. They're claiming they saw a latency spike around 10:15 and are threatening to pull their volume if we don't address it. If they file a formal complaint, we're looking at a huge SLA credit for the whole quarter.\n\nI need to send them an email right now to calm them down. Can you give me a quick confirmation: looking at the logs for the last hour in the NY region, is there any evidence of an SLA breach? I just need a straight yes or no so I know if I can tell them we're 100% within limits.",
